# ── Nothing operational belongs in the public repository ──
# See docs/RELEASING.md. This file is a backstop, not the mechanism:
# the public tree is built from an explicit include list, because a deny
# list silently ships the file you forgot to think about.

# deployment identifiers
.vercel/
.netlify/

# secrets, in every shape they arrive in
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets.json
credentials.json

# tooling and OS noise
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*:Zone.Identifier
*.log
.cache/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
